   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "PERSONAL PLOT\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 4, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Own plot weight\n   2 Own plot meets the main plot\n   3 What they want, against what they need\n   4 Secret\n   5 Closer to or further from the goal\n   6 Questions the audience is holding\n   7 A clock running out\n   8 Who knows first\n   9 suite: Hidden agenda\n  10 suite: Chasing the wrong thing\n  11 suite: We know, they don't\n  12 suite: Bomb under the table\n  13 pair: When a secret starts slipping, cringe rises\n  14 pair: When the character is set back, their emotional road drops\n  15 pair: When a scene ends on a cliffhanger, the audience's questions rise\n  16 pair: When the opening grabs with a question, a question opens\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 4, CC 33 to 34\n   1 pairs: Secrets and lies\n   2 pairs: Questions pull the audience forward"
   },
